 "headlines": {
  "splitStep_uniform": "KemBound -> for every t p created query x: ((handlerWith setup codec route (idealSplit setup codec route checks t p created) query).run x).IsTotalQueryBound (splitWeight caps (commandKind query)); splitWeight = [1, 64 + keygenCost, 32, 140 + encapsCost, 108 + 64 + 64, 69 * max 64 decapsCost + 64, 64, 64, 64, 64, 64, 64]",
  "guessStep_uniform / guessStep_base": "every step of guessReg: IsMlKemUniformQuery <= splitWeight caps (commandKind query) (KemBound); IsMlKemBaseQuery 0",
  "flat_uniform / game_uniform": "one complete-interface query: <= guessWeight caps bounds (queryClass query); whole guesser game against a budget-respecting adversary: <= sum_kind guessWeight kind * budget.cap kind",
  "guessWeight_eq": "guessWeight caps bounds = splitWeight on the twelve native classes, test 1 + 64 + 64, fresh bounds.max + 64 + 64",
  "guessBill / guessBill_eq": "guessBill caps qInit B bounds = (B.create + 1) * keygenCost + (qInit + 32) + sum_kind B.cap kind * guessWeight kind = (qCreate + 1)keygenCost + (qInit + 32) + qCoin + (64 + keygenCost)qCreate + 32 qBundle + (140 + encapsCost)qAccept + 236 qBuild + (69 max(64, decapsCost) + 64)qFinish + 64(qHmac + qHash + qServerSend + qServerRaw + qBeaconSend + qBeaconRaw) + 129 qTest + (bounds.max + 128)qFresh",
  "anomalyGuesser_uniform / anomalyGuesser_base": "anomalyGuesser (Target count) ...: IsMlKemUniformQuery <= (count + 1) keygenCost + (qInit + 32) + sum_kind budget.cap kind * guessWeight kind (KemBound, initBound, Respects); IsMlKemBaseQuery 0",
  "ptc_bills": "(ptc setup.kem (anomalyGuesser setup codec route checks (Target.ofCE budget g) ensureInit 0 runtime bounds mode adversary)).MakesAtMostQueries (guessBill caps qInit budget bounds) 0 (budget.finish + 1) 0 0 0 (KemBound, initBound, budget.Respects)",
  "a1_bills": "ReductionBills of serverAuthAdversary c at coinCap, qAccept, romCap, hashCap, totalCap, qFinish from KemBound and the budget alone (no CE-A1 security premise)",
  "headline_bills": "HeadlineBills = TargetBills (kem: kem_transfer_bills; slot: allIdeal_bills at compileFull, transported caps; beta: ptc_bills; auth/records at BI_g) and A1Bills, A2Bills (a2_bills), InjBills (collider_bills), PairBills (pair_bills); premises SourceFullCorrect, KemBound, initBound, budget.Respects",
  "billed forms (PqxdhDeploymentHeadlineGated)": "ce_app(_target)_billed, ce_or_s2b(_target)_billed, ce_uks_sender(_target)_billed, ce_lor(_target)_billed: frozen bound and TargetBills; ce_or_s2b_sym_billed, ce_uks_sym_billed, ce_app_beacon_sym_billed: and TargetBills and A1Bills; ce_app_sym_billed: TargetBills, A2Bills, A1Bills; symbolic_lor_bound_billed: TargetBills, A2Bills, A1Bills, InjBills; ce_or_injective_s2b(_full)_billed: TargetBills, A1Bills, InjBills; anomaly_beta_billed: anomaly_beta and ptc_bills. Same binders and premises as the frozen theorems (anomaly_beta_billed adds KemBound, initBound, Respects).",
  "game_ghost": "PqxdhDeploymentSecrecy.game ... .run runtime = forget <$> (gameG ...).run runtime (the ghost-instrumented experiment: handlerG logs the created owners' KEM keys and each raw accept attempt's encapsulation (verified PQ key, ciphertext array) at the encapsulate callback)",
  "acceptEnc_expect / create_expect / handlerG_expect / expected_run_le": "the logged encapsulation is a fresh draw encC setup key after the key is fixed; the create logs one keyGen setup draw; a ghost potential whose expectation does not increase over these draws (and over none) does not increase over any query or over the run",
  "triple_le": "for every owner index k and raw accept attempts i < j: Pr[TripleColl k i j] in gameG <= pairCollision setup (potential phi: pairCollision with nothing drawn, CP(pk_k), KG(pk) D_pk(c), [pk = pk_k] D_pk_k(c), [repeat] KG(pk), collision indicator; pairHit_mean: E_keygen[CP] = pairCollision)",
  "Tracks / tracks_step / tracks_game": "run invariant of gameG (Phase1ReadBack, Phase2ReadBack): encs indexed by sessions = accept count; acceptOf -> verified key of the logged encapsulation; pending token -> logged ciphertext; buildOf read back -> logged ciphertext; keys = owners' KEM keys; bundleOf publishedPq -> logged key",
  "ctColl_triple": "on every outcome of gameG of a budget-respecting adversary: happens (ctCollEvent crypto codec) (forget outcome) -> exists k < qCreate, j < qAccept, i < j, TripleColl k i j outcome",
  "ct_collision_game": "ctCollTerm setup codec checks route ensureInit bounds mode adversary runtime <= ((budget.create * budget.accept.choose 2 : Nat) : ENNReal) * pairCollision setup (Phase1ReadBack, Phase2ReadBack, budget.Respects)",
  "ct_coll_le / ctCollEps": "ctCollTerm ... <= ctCollEps setup budget = (qCreate * C(qAccept, 2)) * (ofReal Adv^IND-CCA(pairAdversary) + 2 * ofReal correctnessError + 2^-256) (adds FunctionalDecapsulation, through pair_cp_le); ct_coll_billed adds pair_bills (KemBound); ctCollEps_le_design: at most the design form with (qCreate + 1)",
  "closed forms (PqxdhDeploymentHeadlineCtClosed)": "ce_or_s2b_sym_closed, ce_uks_sym_closed, symbolic_lor_closed (+ FunctionalDecapsulation), symbolic_lor_bound_closed, ce_or_injective_s2b_closed, ce_or_injective_s2b_full_closed: frozen bound with ctCollTerm replaced by ctCollEps setup budget, frozen premises; ce_or_s2b_sym_closed_billed, ce_uks_sym_closed_billed, symbolic_lor_bound_closed_billed, ce_or_injective_s2b_closed_billed, ce_or_injective_s2b_full_closed_billed: closed bound, the bills of the Gated billed form, and PairBills setup caps"
 },
 "deviations_from_design": [
  "weights of the guesser game proved on the split handler itself (splitWeight) rather than valued by idealStep_bound, uniformCap and OpenUniform.total: query bounds do not transfer along ideal_splits (an equality in law; plan section 93 (a))",
  "one finish weight (the real finish's 69 * max 64 decapsCost, which dominates the challenge finish by challenge_le) plus the Beacon install seed",
  "a test query is charged at both send classes (wrapCost), so u(test) = 129",
  "CE-A1 bills through a1_bills (resource premises only) rather than ce_a1_billed (security premises)",
  "HeadlineBills split into five parts so that each billed headline conjoins only the bills of its terms; PairBills only in HeadlineBills",
  "billed forms generated textually from the frozen statements (ce12/p2b/gen/gated.py); the per-target P1 forms and anomaly_beta billed too; ce_kt forms (no beta_g) not billed",
  "commit messages of 3b12a590 and f147bf69 miscount their theorems (17 and 7 for 14 and 6)",
  "step 2: factor qCreate * C(qAccept, 2) instead of (qCreate + 1) * C(qAccept, 2): only created owners hold KEM keys and the transcript counts bound them by qCreate (ctCollEps_le_design records the comparison)",
  "step 2: route via a ghost-instrumented copy of the experiment and an expected-potential (supermartingale) argument per triple instead of a game decomposition at two accept ordinals; the design's hit set is replaced by the union over triples, and an owner created after the earlier accept is covered by the KG factor, so CP is averaged over key generation (pairCollision)",
  "step 2: closed forms are new theorems generated from the frozen statements (ce12/p2b/gen/closed.py); symbolic_lor_closed adds FunctionalDecapsulation; the five step-1 billed forms are closed too, with PairBills",
  "step 2: the first focused check-inventory of PqxdhDeploymentHeadlineCtGhost failed (unescaped ? in generated rg patterns); fixed and rerun before the commit; that commit was made by hand after the helper stopped on a relative message path"
 ],
